# A self-contained sandbox: a Python venv + livekit-agents + model weights. It is referenced by NO
# application build or dependency config (see RESULT.json.sandboxIsolation). Only requirements.txt
# and run_livekit_eot.py are committed; everything below is downloaded or generated at run time.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
models/
hf-cache/

# probe I/O written by run.mts / run_livekit_eot.py per run (the readings are in RESULT.json.groupC)
*out.json
_items.json
